OL,3,GNEWSAFootball stadium food truck is
OL,4,A'changing lives'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA food trailer at a football stadium is
OL,7,Foffering paid work to young people as
OL,8,Fpart of an initiative to tackle youth
OL,9,Funemployment.
OL,11,FStuffed Gourmet Trailers has received a
OL,12,F#42,000 investment from the Big Issue
OL,13,Fto employ and train young people not in
OL,14,Feducation, employment or training at
OL,15,FSouthampton's St Mary's Stadium.
OL,17,FThe young people involved come from
OL,18,FSaints Works, an employability
OL,19,Fprogramme for 18 and 19 year olds run
OL,20,Fby the club's charitable arm - the
OL,21,FSaints Foundation.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
