OL,3,GNEWSAFootball stadium food truck is
OL,4,A'changing lives'
OL,5,
OL,6,FJack Trebilcock is one of the young
OL,7,Fpeople now employed on the food truck,
OL,8,Fand said he had been forced to finish
OL,9,Fschool early "due to personal
OL,10,Fcircumstances".
